# Ledger Shredder, played for real. The ruling: a creature told to connive that has left the battlefield still
# connives, and a nonland discard puts a counter on nothing. Turn 5 Bot1 casts its second Pyrite Spellbomb; with the
# trigger on the stack Bot2 Lightning Bolts the Shredder. The trigger still resolves for Bot1, its controller: Bot1
# draws the third Spellbomb and discards it.

